  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1d57f947-78e1-4447-a58d-0dcdc73ac602-747152db-886a-4152-bd0a-8366ff5a6a32-9894007_2.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 197px;\" /></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;be the tension in cable.</p><p>Since the system&nbsp;is at equilibrium, the net torque, about an axis perpendicular to the plane and passing through the point of contact of the rod and&nbsp;the wall, is zero. Therefore, torque about point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>800</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>.</p>",
